# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SHARMA GLOBAL LLC website — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env.local (it is already gitignored).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Contact form delivery.
# The contact form posts submissions as JSON to this URL.
#
# Current setup: FormSubmit.co (no account needed).
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/business.dipaksharma@gmail.com
#   - The FIRST submission triggers a one-time activation email from
#     FormSubmit to that inbox — click "Activate" once and all later
#     messages are delivered normally.
#   - After activation, FormSubmit shows a random alias endpoint in the
#     activation email; you can use that alias URL here instead to keep
#     the raw address out of configs.
#
# Other options: Formspree (https://formspree.io), Web3Forms
# (https://web3forms.com), or your own API/webhook.
# Until this is set, the form shows visitors a clear "not active yet"
# notice instead of pretending the message was sent.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
